{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b", "content": "He opened his eyes to a ceiling that flickered with pixelated static, and a faint health bar hovered in the corner of his vision, pulsing green. The familiar scent of his coffee was replaced by the sterile smell of ozone, and when he tried to sit up, a tooltip appeared above his hands: \"Press E to interact.\" Confused, he glanced around the room and saw the walls rendered in low‑poly textures, the sunlight outside his window reduced to a looping skybox that never changed. Every movement triggered a soft chime, and his thoughts felt oddly delayed, as if the world were waiting for his input before rendering the next frame.\n\n***\nDetermined to test the limits of his new reality, he sprinted toward the door, watching his stamina bar drain and refill in real time, and discovered that by holding the sprint button he could phase through the solid wood as if it were a mere collision mesh. Laughing, he began to manipulate the environment—spawning health packs with a thought, rewinding time to undo a misstep, and even pausing the game to stare at the frozen NPCs whose eyes followed him with empty, programmed curiosity. In that moment, he realized he wasn’t just a player; he was the glitch, the anomaly, and the only one who could rewrite the code of his own existence.", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.04538470506668091}, {"token": " need", "logprob": -0.004544050898402929}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.3865150213241577}, {"token": " write", "logprob": -0.5538591742515564}, {"token": " exactly", "logprob": -0.9928789138793945}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.029777957126498222}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " paragraphs", "logprob": -2.0265558760002023e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.46786004304885864}, {"token": " separated", "logprob": -0.006360288243740797}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.005243359133601